FTX+AAI+++VERIFICATION INTEGRITY: All verification links are active and provide current records. The official DBD portal and synchronized databases confirm active good standing. Verification is straightforward and possible in English.'

FTX+AAI+++BUSINESS MODEL: The company operates exclusively as a pure B2B wholesaler and logistics partner supplying authorized retailers under DDP terms. No direct-to-consumer sales or public shop exist. This is the worldwide established standard in wholesale distribution to protect retailer margins and comply with competition regulations. Public consumer reviews are therefore neither generated nor relevant.'

FTX+AAI+++EUROPEAN PARTNER GATEWAY: ctg-group.eu is the dedicated technical B2B EDI gateway for automated order processing, DDP logistics and customs handling with verified European partners. This professional setup is common for international B2B wholesalers. Full legal documents and references are provided directly to qualified partners upon request.'

